+      "title": "What you know",
+      "content": "You know *decir que* and the tense shifts of reported speech from B1 Unit 13 and B2 Unit 17. You also know a few reporting verbs: *afirmar* and *declarar* from B1 Unit 13, *asegurar* from B1 Unit 33, *advertir* and *sugerir* from B1 Unit 38, and *negar* and *desmentir* from B2 Unit 5. A reporting verb does more than say that someone spoke. It also says how the thing was said: firmly, as an admission, as a warning, as a blame. This lesson gives you the set of verbs and the rule for the mood that follows them. The next four lessons practise one group each."
